# Secrets — NEVER COMMIT
.env
_to_delete/

# Runtime log sidecars. These carry prompt hashes, user ids and error strings,
# they are append-only, and they are per-deployment — none of that belongs in
# git. Added 2026-09-20 with the §4.5 request log; sim_monitor.jsonl predates
# it and was untracked only by luck.
*.jsonl

# …except the Alpha program's own record. `findings.jsonl` is the feedback
# channel the builders read and the master session assigns from, and
# `ledger.jsonl` is the per-milestone cost log. Both are durable program
# state that must survive a restart and a branch switch, and the handoff
# requires them committed. Added 2026-10-21 with the Alpha program.
!.claude/shared-memory/alpha/*.jsonl

